---
// Replaces Starlight's ThemeProvider. The stock one reads localStorage, falls
// back to prefers-color-scheme, and writes data-theme on <html> — which landed
// /docs in light mode, a white page one click from a site that is dark
// everywhere else. Setting data-theme from config `head` did not hold: that
// script is emitted BEFORE this component's, so Starlight simply overwrote it.
// Replacing the component removes the only writer.
//
// StarlightThemeProvider.updatePickers is part of the contract — ThemeSelect is
// emptied in astro.config.mjs, but Starlight's own scripts still call it.
---

{/* Inlined, like the original, so there is no flash. */}
<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "dark";
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
